{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <h5><strong>3. V\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059<\/strong><\/h5><h6><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;3.1&nbsp; V\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002<\/strong><\/h6><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:72.3%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><ul><li><p>\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u65e5\u672c\u9152\u3092\u98f2\u3093<strong>\u3060\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059<\/strong>\u3002<\/p><p>T\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng u\u1ed1ng r\u01b0\u1ee3u Nh\u1eadt.<\/p><\/li><li><p>\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306f\u96ea\u3092\u898b<strong>\u305f\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002<\/strong><\/p><p>T\u00f4i ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y tuy\u1ebft.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h6><u>a. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/u>&nbsp;<\/h6><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;D\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng kinh nghi\u1ec7m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n th\u00e2n, \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng tr\u1ea3i nhi\u1ec7m g\u00ec, ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3.<\/p><h6><u>b. \u00dd ngh\u0129a&nbsp;<\/u><\/h6><p>\u30fb&nbsp;\u201ct\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng \u2026.\u201d<\/p><p>&nbsp;\u30fb\u201ct\u00f4i ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng \u2026.\u201d<\/p><h6><u>c. C\u1ea5u tr\u00fac<\/u><\/h6><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:56.54%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\" style=\"background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 90%);\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">V<strong><u>\u305f\u3053\u3068<\/u><\/strong>\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002<\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">T\u00f4i \u0111\u00e3 t\u1eebng\u2026<\/span><\/p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">V<strong><u>\u305f\u3053\u3068<\/u><\/strong>\u304c\u3